      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Loeg claims that sickness is a \r\npunishment for past actions. \r\nIn Phindym, his homeland, \r\neveryone shares this belief.",
        "Jp" : "病は過去の行いに対する報いだと\r\nロイグが言うんです\r\n故郷のフィンダムでは皆そう考えると"
