      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 19,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Oh—scarlet sickness is quite a rarity, isn't it?",
        "Jp" : "ほう――赤色症とはまた珍しいですね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 377200,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 20,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The flowers that released the pollen which\r\ncauses the illness have almost gone extinct,\r\ndevoured by the orcs...",
        "Jp" : "病の原因となる花粉をばらまいていた花は\r\nオークたちに食べられてほとんど絶滅――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 377201,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 21,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hypothetically, even if they were still\r\naround, they wouldn't emit enough pollen\r\nto cause illness in people.",
        "Jp" : "仮に残っていたとしても、人を病気にするほど\r\n花粉を出すこともないでしょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 377202,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 22,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It's quite mysterious—\r\nThe patient must surely have a\r\nremarkably low resistance to the disease.\r\nWhat kind of person are they?",
        "Jp" : "不思議ですね――\r\nその患者は、病気に対し、よほど無垢な身体を\r\n持っているに違いありません\r\nどのような人なのですか？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 377203,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
